    {
      "id": "findings",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 395,
      "width": 1080.3427734375,
      "height": 144.9,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": [],
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "b0G",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "• NS-1 baseline (5-fold held-out): AUC 0.959 · real damped 99.4% (×0.896) · noise ×0.783\n• E2E on real data: reporting 5 of 1,718 doc-gen runs → 31/37 unreported lookalikes damped harder; undo restores 50/50\n• E2E red on trunk (by design): 30/30 full-text hits unscored · 0/10 real-topic results undamped\n• 42 persona sessions unflagged: synced before #145, backfill never re-run\n• ~2,700 templated agent-run sessions the automated classifier doesn't know (doc reviewers, Linear fetchers…)\n• FTS slowness root cause: planner guesses 15 sessions, gets 6,425 → recomputes to_tsvector on ~920k msgs, never uses GIN index.\n   MATERIALIZED-CTE rewrite: 60.6s → 47ms, identical rows (broad queries still 18–46s)",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2030329481,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "• NS-1 baseline (5-fold held-out): AUC 0.959 · real damped 99.4% (×0.896) · noise ×0.783\n• E2E on real data: reporting 5 of 1,718 doc-gen runs → 31/37 unreported lookalikes damped harder; undo restores 50/50\n• E2E red on trunk (by design): 30/30 full-text hits unscored · 0/10 real-topic results undamped\n• 42 persona sessions unflagged: synced before #145, backfill never re-run\n• ~2,700 templated agent-run sessions the automated classifier doesn't know (doc reviewers, Linear fetchers…)\n• FTS slowness root cause: planner guesses 15 sessions, gets 6,425 → recomputes to_tsvector on ~920k msgs, never uses GIN index.\n   MATERIALIZED-CTE rewrite: 60.6s → 47ms, identical rows (broad queries still 18–46s)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1790216702423,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 178730215,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
